1 NAME Tuda Mangu (Tode Mangu) /son of Hulagu and Mangu Timur's successor - r.1280-1287/
2 GIVN Tuda Mangu (Tode Mangu)
2 _MARNM son of Hulagu and Mangu Timur's successor - r.1280-1287
