2 CONC fils d’Abaqa Khan” killed “Baidou fils de Taraghai fils de Holagou Khan” and succeeded as Khan[338].  He converted to Islam 19 Jun 1295 and adopted the name MAHMUD.  He adopted Islam as the state religion of the Ilkhanate in 1295[
2 CONC 339].  In 1303, Emperor Andronikos II requested his help to fight the Turks and arranged his marriage with his own reputed illegitimate daughter ] ref: http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/MONGOLS.htm#NairaquBuqa
