2 CONC d Herat Nov 1327).  m secondly (Tabriz [Feb/Mar] 1336) ARPA KAUN Il-Khan, son of SOSA.  m thirdly (1339) SULAYMAN Il-Khan, .  Sati-Beg & her first husband had one child:  (a)       SURGAN (-executed Diyarbekir 1345).  Governor of 
2 CONC Qarabagh 1336.  Governor of Iraq 1340. 
