1 NAME Amir Agha Khan Soltan - Agha Khan e Avval - Ibrahim Khalil of the Bayat tribe of the Bayat tribe of the Afshar clan of the Azeri Confederacy of the Otuz Iqi Oghuz Turks of Karabakh /Moghadam - Javanshir (r:1606-1625)/
