2 CONT Kulpa ( Kulna ; d. 1360 ) - Khan of Ulus Jochi (Golden Horde) (August 1359  - January 1360 ). Origin unknown, impostor. In August 1359, Khan Berdibek was killed in the Horde . Kulpa became Khan, who declared himself the son of Jan
2 CONC ibek Khan , that is, the brother of Berdibek. He killed some of the emirs loyal to the former khan, and started a war against the rest. One of these emirs was temnik Mamai , who was married to Berdibek's daughter. He seized power 
2 CONC on the right bank of the Volga. Some emirs invited Chimtai , the khan of the White Horde , to the throne , who sent his brother, the Horde-Sheikh , to Sarai . But he was killed on the way. In addition, at the end of 1359 Khizr pro
2 CONC claimed himself a khan in Gulistan. Kulpa himself was overthrown and killed with two sons in January 1360 Nauruz .
