2 CONT *3.         NEDA ([1295/98]-after 1346).  ... ... ...
2 CONT
2 CONT  King Stefan Uroš II Milutin had one illegitimate son by Mistress (1):
2 CONT *4.          STEFAN UROŠ ([1276]-murdered 3 Nov 1336, bur Visoki Dečani monastery). ... ... ...
2 CONT
