2 CONC egis sebasto domino Joanne Cantacuzeno...”[449].  The record of the synod of 6 Mar 1166 records the presence of “...pansebasto sebasto et genero...nostri regis domino Joanne Cantacuzeno...”[450].  m ([1145/50]) as her second husba
