2 CONT a)         '''--- Tornikaine'''.   Pachymeres records the marriage of "Constantini Tornicii filiam" and "fratrem…Ioannes" (referring to the future Emperor Mikhael VIII)[901].  Her parentage is confirmed by Ephræmius which records 
