1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Michael of Chernigov
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael was the only known son of Vsevolod IV of Kiev by Anastasia, a daughter of Prince Casimir II of Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Casimir II the Just
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Around 1163, Casimir married with Helena (b. ca. 1140/42 - d. ca. 1202/06), daughter of Conrad II, Duke of Znaim, member of the Premyslid dinasty of Bohemia.[2][3][4]. They had seven children:[5][6]
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria (b. 1164 - d. 1194), married in November 1178 to Prince Vsevolod IV of Kiev.
2 CONT
2 CONT Casimir (b. ca. 1165? - d. 1 March 1167).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bolesław (b. ca. 1168/71 - d. 16 April 1182). He died accidentally, after falling from a tree.
2 CONT
2 CONT Odon, died in infancy. Only named in the Polish Wikipedia Biography of Casimir II the Just
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelaide (b. ca. 1177/84 - d. 8 December 1211), foundress of the convent of St. Jakob in Sandomierz. Only named in the Polish Wikipedia Biography of Casimir II the Just
2 CONT
2 CONT Leszek the White (b. ca. 1186/87 - d. Marcinkow, 23 November 1227).
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad (b. ca. 1187/88 - d. 31 August 1247).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogy.euweb.cz/piast/piast3.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Kazimierz II  "Sprawiedliwy" "the Just", Pr of Sandomir and Cracow 1177, Pr of Kujawia and Mazowia 1186, Ct of Poland (1177-94), *1138, +5.5.1194; 1m: ca 1163 Helena of Znaim (+1202/06); 2m: 1185/86 Yelena, dau.of Great Pr of Kiev
2 CONC ; he left issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT     * A1. [1m.] Kazimierz, *after 1164, +2.3.1167
2 CONT
2 CONT     * A2. [1m.] Boleslaw, *1168, +16.4.1182
2 CONT
2 CONT     * A3. [2m.] Leszek I "Bialy" "the White", Pr of Cracow and Sandomir (1194-99)+(1201)+(1202-27), Duke of Poland (1202-27), *1186/87, +Marcinkow 23.11.1227; m.1207 Gremislawa of Lutsk (+1258)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o B1. Boleslaw V "Wstydliwy" "the Modest", Pr of Cracow (1243-79) and Sandomir (1233-79), *21.6.1226, +7.12.1279; m.1239 Kunigunde of Hungary (*1234 +24.7.1292)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o B2. Salomea, *1211/12, +Skala, nr Krakow 10.11.1268; m.1214 Pr Koloman of Halicz (+1241)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * A4. [2m.] Pr Konrad I of Cracow, Masovia (1202-31) and Kujavia (1228-31), Ct of Poland (1229-32)+(1241-43), *1187/8, +1247; m.1207 Agafija, dau.of Pr Svyatoslay of Novgorod-Severskiy
2 CONT
2 CONT           o B1. Pr Boleslaw I of Masovia, *1208, +25.2.1248; 1m: ca 1232 Gertrud of Silesia (+1244); 2m: 1245/47 Anastasija of Bielsk
2 CONT
