2 CONC I of Kiev. Verchoslava Vsevolodovna. Married Rostislav II of Kiev. Konstantin of Rostov (18 May 1186 – 2 February 1218). Boris Vsevolodovich. (c. 1187–1238). Gleb Vsevolodovich (d. 29 September 1189). Yuri II of Vladimir (1189 – 4
