2 CONT     * C.M. Brand, Byzantium Confronts the West (Cambridge, MA, 1968)
2 CONT     * Jonathan Harris, Byzantium and the Crusades (London and New York, 2003)
2 CONT     * Jonathan Harris, Constantinople: Capital of Byzantium (London and New York, 2007)
2 CONT     * The Oxford Dictionary of Byzantium (Oxford , 1991), 3 vols.
