2 CONT ****** F1. Thomas Komnenodukas, Despot and Archon of Epirus and Aetolia, *1288/89, +murdered by his uncle Nicholas Orsini, Count of Cephalonia 1318; m.1313 Anna Palaiologina (+1321)
