2 CONT '''Ruryk Rostislavich''' (Рюрик Ростиславич in Ukrainian) (? - 1215), Prince of Novgorod (1170-1171), Belgorod Kievsky, presently Bilohorodka (1173-1194), Grand Prince of Kiev (1173, 1180-1182, 1194-1202, 1203-1205, 1206, 1207-121
2 CONC 0), Prince of Chernigov (1210-1214).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links==
