2 CONT Father: Iaroslav Vsevolodich Mother: Fedosia Igorevich of Riazan Spouses:  Natalia, Xenia Iurievna, daughter of Iurii Mikhailovich Issue:  Sviatoslav Iaroslavich, Mikhail Iaroslavich (1), Unknown Iaroslavna, Sofia Iaroslavna, Dani
2 CONC il Iaroslavich, Mikhail Iaroslavich (2)
