2 CONC as captured and imprisoned at Navarino by the forces of Hugues[231].  He was among the envoys who went to Naples in 1374 to offer the principality of Achaia to Jeanne I Queen of Naples following the death of Philippe di Tarento in
2 CONC  1373[232]. 
