2 CONT ******F3. [1m.] Saint Erzsébet, canonized 28.5.1235, *Bratislava (Presburg) 1207, +Marburg 17.11.1231; m.1221 Ldgve Ludwig IV of Thuringia (+1227) 
2 CONT ******F4. [1m.] Kálmán, Duke of Croatia (1208-41), Duke of Halicz (1214-19)+(1219-21) and Carinthia, *1208, +k.a.1241; m.1214 Salome of Cracow (*1211 +10.11.1268) 
2 CONT ******F5. [1m.] András, King of Halicz, *1210/12, +1234; m.1221-27 Maria/Helena, dau.of Prince Mstislav of Novgorod 
2 CONT ******* ...
2 CONT ******F7. [2m.] Jolán (Yolande), *ca 1215, +Huesca 9.10.1251; m.Barcelona 8.9.1235 King Jaime I of Aragon (*1207 +1276) 
2 CONT ******F8. [3m.] István (Stefan), Duke of Slavonia, Patrician of Venice, *1236, +1271; 1m: 1263 Elizabeth (+1264), dau. of Guglielmo Traversari, Patrician of Ravenna; 2m: Tommasina (+1300), dau.of Micaele Sbarra Morosini, Patrician
2 CONC  of Venice
