2 CONT 4.         TAMARA (-after [1252]).  Ephræmius names "Thamar germana soror" of "Callimanus", son of "Asanes" by his wife "Maria genus de populo Pæonum"[319].  Georgius Akropolites names "Callimano soror…Thamari"[320].  Georgius Akr
