2 CONC 317].  Her marriage was agreed to confirm the alliance between her father and the Nikaian emperor, who were planning a joint attack on Constantinople[318].  m (Betrothed [1233], Lampsaka early 1235) THEODOROS Dukas Laskaris of Nik
