2 CONT The marriage of Salome's sister Richeza with Duke Vladislav I of Bohemia in 1110 changed the status of the relative obscure Count Henry of Berg in the political affairs. Another sister, Sophie married with another member of the Pr
2 CONC emyslid dynasty, Otto II the Black, Duke of Olomouc, in 1113.
