2 CONT [edit] Bolesław III's Testament
2 CONT
2 CONT Main article: Testament of Bolesław III Krzywousty
2 CONT
2 CONT Bolesław III died on 28 October 1138. Before his death, in his will he divided the country between his sons. In addition Salomea received the town of Łęczyca, several castles and towns throughout Poland (including Pajęczno, Małogo
