2 CONC obtain the full sovereignty over the land for her life, and could loss it in two cases: if she remarried or became a nun (the self-resignation wasn't count). The youngest child of the couple, Casimir, wasn't assigned any province;
2 CONC  it is speculated that he was born after Bolesław III's death.
