2 CONT
2 CONT  Litvina A. F., Uspensky F. B. The choice of the name of the Russian princes in the X-XVI centuries. Dynastic history through the prism of anthroponymy. - M .: Indrik, 2006 .-- 904 p. - 1000 copies. - ISBN 5-85759-339-5. P. 269
2 CONT  Litvin. In the same place. P. 271
2 CONT  Litvin ... Ibid. P. 275
2 CONT  Mikhailov M.I. Rogvolodov stone. // Monuments of Russian clothing paleography. (A handbook for students of the Imperial St. Petersburg Archaeological Institute.). - SPb .: R. Golike and A. Vilborg T-in, 1913. - S. 17. - 59 p. Arc
2 CONC hived copy (inaccessible link). Retrieved September 2, 2014. Archived March 6, 2016.
2 CONT  Patriarchal, or Nikon Chronicle. - S. 167.
