2 CONC ałką razem z ojcem. 
2 CONT Żona: Mamelfa. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE-%D0%94%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE_%D0%9C%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87 Wikipedia UA] 
